      }
    },
    "This conversation was started with a different model provider than the one %@ uses now, and %@ only continues a conversation on its own provider. Switch back to that provider in %@’s settings and reload, or start a new conversation. (%@)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个会话是用另一个模型供应商开始的，与 %1$@ 现在使用的不同，而 %2$@ 只会在原来的供应商上继续会话。请在 %3$@ 设置里切回那个供应商后重新加载，或者开始新会话。（%4$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This conversation will be cut back to this reply and renamed “[Fork] …”. The full original stays as a separate conversation." : {
